    "role": "coin-price-feed",
    "branchModel": "single-path",
    "branchApplicability": {
      "disposition": "top-level-only",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-08-24",
      "reviewer": "OpenAI Codex W1b oracle applicability review",
      "rationale": "sUSDe's vault exchange rate values each share against the USDe held by the staking contract for minting and redemption, so the pro-rata share quote is a price-sensitive top-level authority. sUSDe creates no borrower-owned debt positions or collateral-liquidation markets, and therefore needs no branch rows.",
